    "reason": "The upgrade guide [ev-9f4292160fa2] says the `querier.worker-parallelism` CLI flag and its YAML setting are removed, and recommends `querier.max-concurrent` instead; the changelog [ev-4b79cb1a8226] also says it is removed. So \"removed\" with max-concurrent as the replacement is right. The subject is wrong, though. The evidence names a CLI flag, `querier.worker-parallelism`. It never spells out the YAML key, so the proposed config-key (path \"worker-parallelism\", component \"querier\") was made up by splitting the flag name. The default change for `querier.max-concurrent` is a separate change and is left out here.",
